  "description": "Connects the OASIS to the Algorand pure-PoS blockchain via the Algod REST API (Algonode.io). Maps Algorand accounts to OASIS Avatars and transactions/ASAs to OASIS Holons. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
